  "comment": "ISS-1404: shared with the Mac loader. Each case lists the files of one ledger directory and the duplicate_id warnings the loader must emit (one per claiming file, the exported duplicateIdMessage bytes). A display-id collision is not a duplicate: reconcile fixes it, and writes stay allowed.",
